@Host = http://localhost:5183

### PB-01 catálogos (HU1 tipos + HU2 géneros)
GET {{Host}}/api/account/catalogos
Accept: application/json

### PB-01 registro paciente (HU1+HU2). multipart (HU3 sin tarjeta)
POST {{Host}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=pb01

--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TipoUsuario"

Paciente
--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Nombre"

Camila
--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Apellido"

Rojas
--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Edad"

22
--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="IdGenero"

2
--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Correo"

paciente.nuevo@test.com
--pb01
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Password"

Abc12345
--pb01--

### PB-01 verificar (HU4)
POST {{Host}}/api/account/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "paciente.nuevo@test.com",
  "codigo": "123456"
}

### PB-01 reenviar código (HU4)
POST {{Host}}/api/account/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "paciente.nuevo@test.com"
}
